## GitHub Pages
- vite.config.ts must have base: './'
- All imports relative paths.
- No server-side code.
- Build output to /dist.
- manualChunks must split: vendor-react, vendor-mantine, vendor-charts, vendor-excel, vendor-icons.

## Accessibility
- All icon-only buttons must have aria-label in Hebrew.
- All inputs must have associated label.
- Category select must have aria-label="קטגוריה".

## When editing existing files
- Always read the full file before making changes.
- Never remove existing functionality when adding new features.
- Keep all TypeScript interfaces intact unless explicitly instructed.